      "tree": {
        "sha": "7bb0413d2719b6afab2d164efdecdc4a18a0ad48",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/bitcoin/bitcoin/git/trees/7bb0413d2719b6afab2d164efdecdc4a18a0ad48"
      },
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree 7bb0413d2719b6afab2d164efdecdc4a18a0ad48\nparent ed7dd7cf4e1561a97edf72eba29a67b14e28c717\nauthor Shadow <146137079+0xShadowX@users.noreply.github.com> 1790495699 +0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790495699 +0400\n\nvalidation: don't accept txs to the mempool while loading a snapshot\n\nActivateSnapshot checks that the mempool is empty, then releases cs_main\nwhile PopulateAndValidateSnapshot runs, which can take minutes. A\ntransaction added to the mempool in that window (e.g. through\nsendrawtransaction) made AddChainstate hit its empty-mempool assert after\nthe base blockhash file was already written, and the node then needed\n-reindex to start again.\n\nSet a flag on ChainstateManager for the duration of ActivateSnapshot and\nreject transactions and packages in AcceptToMemoryPool and\nProcessNewPackage while it is set. test_accept calls still work since\nthey don't add anything to the mempool. A second concurrent loadtxoutset\nis rejected while the flag is set.",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquMvTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUvMQAIe2jy9d4eP5cvjlYicutNru\n5AAYHI9/zljnMljLoL9IN6I0W8FX3BihQclLG7YalWVKHhT6+ee01suR+Y26yRlI\np/38Mpg4Ec5GIInXNM+voTLHopodin/auRHjdX8I8RK/O2l2gVe1tdK778jyQuq/\nhGGJWi9z1SJgfT0+4EmltFJyDPiY1I5Q2Ecj7xJbK2VyJcjzKwA/eUgMpyagNALM\n0N/uYOZ3bYHESaMuN1ojH9y+mqwTYfFdD+irh1nYxWC9O0gTv/1kZeUwIYMUmQxc\nBdSHiQtoXEL/aceHGWPUPQJR3cnymyDRCscn7BcsxcfZWjKdNGNXNMaOG7I0hBIq\n9LBpX+9uZ3ffPFJfCF7lusPbJ5QL4dNN+v3WKYLwNCRSovsBi843GtvgWAWe0tyG\nwhnoqZc+mzFZdft6RCCHGZVBVGralOG14qgaKu08pB/fz4CHjIZGfPhK1z33g/jw\nB3O5TjFHUPYzX968oqE9Giw+AelzWFEWBQAGAMu1/ThazwxASM5P/kIXuAFkX/+J\ncy4oFiN2mfn5pPYADArOKsjWUlT/GGCftEab5x4G3Lza8DhEkpFXsoGpR9Ih+6kk\nUsRk4CGGo/Ugl77EH2AD9/mahlscaBKD6XUYq8nnw5K1cUjMhNmC0axuTvCT2ZuC\nOql4rZsIkgF4gpPB6O9M\n=67nX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n"
